---
/** 01 · Hero: promessa, chamadas e composição do produto (dados fictícios). */
---

<div class="herotop">
  <div class="gridbg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <a href="#por-que" class="hbadge up" style="--d:60ms">
      <em>WingsBr</em>Real Estate Intelligence
      <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <h1 class="up" style="--d:140ms">
      Seu projeto imobiliário <span style="color:var(--royal)">ganha asas.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="lead up" style="--d:220ms;text-align:center;margin-inline:auto">
      Do planejamento ao pós-venda, tudo conectado em uma única plataforma. Inteligência, gestão e performance para
      incorporadoras, construtoras, loteadoras e imobiliárias.
    </p>
    <div class="up" style="--d:300ms;display:flex;gap:11px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center">
      <a href="#cta" class="btn">
        Agende sua demonstração
        <svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#demo" class="btn ol">
        Explorar a plataforma
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap stage">
    <div class="pcard up" style="--d:380ms">
      <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="pgrid">
        <div class="pcol">
          <span class="ey lt">Residencial Alameda · exemplo</span>
          <h3>A operação do lançamento, em uma tela.</h3>
          <p class="lead lt" style="font-size:14px">
            Planejamento, cronograma, campanhas e funil no mesmo lugar — no desktop e no celular da equipe.
          </p>
          <div class="dcard">
            <span class="ic">
              <svg
                width="17"
                height="17"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M3 18l6-6 4 4 7-7M15 9h5v5"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span style="flex:1">
              <b>R$ 386,4 mil</b>
              <span>Investimento previsto no plano</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="dcard">
            <span class="ic">
              <svg
                width="17"
                height="17"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M20 12a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span style="flex:1">
              <b>16 de 32 entregas</b>
              <span>Cronograma e produção em dia</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="phonewrap">
          <div class="phone">
            <i class="hwbtn" style="top:118px;left:-2.5px;width:2.5px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <i class="hwbtn" style="top:158px;left:-2.5px;width:2.5px;height:44px" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <i class="hwbtn" style="top:214px;left:-2.5px;width:2.5px;height:44px" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <i class="hwbtn" style="top:172px;right:-2.5px;width:2.5px;height:68px" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div class="screen">
              <div class="island" aria-hidden="true">
                <i></i>
              </div>
              <div class="app">
                <div class="apphead">
                  <div>
                    <small>Hoje · 14 out</small>
                    <b>Residencial Alameda</b>
                  </div>
                  <div class="av">RA</div>
                </div>
                <div class="ringwrap">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 150 150" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle
                      cx="75"
                      cy="75"
                      r="52"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.055)"
                      stroke-width="11"
                    ></circle>
                    <circle class="ring" cx="75" cy="75" r="52" fill="none" stroke="#3FBFEE" stroke-width="11"></circle>
                  </svg>
                  <div class="ringtx">
                    <b>50%</b>
                    <span>16 / 32 entregas</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="wrow">
                  <span class="wi">
                    <svg
                      width="15"
                      height="15"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.9"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  <span style="flex:1">
                    <b>Lead distribuído</b>
                    <span>Mariana Costa · Corretora</span>
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="wrow">
                  <span class="wi">
                    <svg
                      width="15"
                      height="15"
                      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.9"
                      aria-hidden="true"
                    >
                      <path d="M4 5h16l-6 7v6l-4 2v-8z"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  <span style="flex:1">
                    <b>Proposta enviada</b>
                    <span>Unidade 1204 · há 8 min</span>
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="homebar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fbadge" style="top:-14px;left:-58px">
            <span class="fi">
              <svg
                width="16"
                height="16"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M12 3l9 9-9 9-9-9z"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <b>Rodada de Negócios</b>
              <span>Etapa atual · 10 a 16/10</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="fbadge b2" style="bottom:72px;right:-62px">
            <span class="fi">
              <svg
                width="16"
                height="16"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M4 20h16M7 16v-3M11 16V9M15 16v-5M19 16V5"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>
              <b>49 registros</b>
              <span>Sincronizados agora</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pcol">
          <div class="dcard" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px">
            <span style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dmuted)">
              Composição do investimento
            </span>
            <div style="display:flex;width:100%;height:8px;gap:2px;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden">
              <i style="flex:29;background:#fff"></i>
              <i style="flex:27;background:#017EFF"></i>
              <i style="flex:25;background:#3FBFEE"></i>
              <i style="flex:19;background:#51688F"></i>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dmuted)">
              <span>Rádio e outdoor 29%</span>
              <span>Digital 27%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dcard" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px">
            <span style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dmuted)">
              Jornada do lançamento
            </span>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%">
              <i style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#3FBFEE"></i>
              <i style="flex:1;height:2px;background:#3FBFEE"></i>
              <i style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#3FBFEE"></i>
              <i style="flex:1;height:2px;background:#3FBFEE"></i>
              <i style="width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#071A36;border:3px solid #3FBFEE"></i>
              <i style="flex:1;height:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14)"></i>
              <i style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18)"></i>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dmuted)">
              <span>Preparação</span>
              <span>Lançamento</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dcard">
            <span class="ic">
              <svg
                width="17"
                height="17"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.8"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M12 3v7M12 10l-7 6M12 10l7 6M5 16v4M19 16v4"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span style="flex:1">
              <b>Distribuição automática</b>
              <span>Por categoria e equipe</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mono" style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--soft)">
      Interface ilustrativa · dados fictícios
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
